        "message": "fix: supply AUTH_SECRET to E2E compose interpolation for CI\n\nThe base compose hard-requires ${AUTH_SECRET:?}; on dev machines the\n.env file masks this, but CI has no .env so compose up failed during\ninterpolation. The harness now owns all three required values\n(POSTGRES_PASSWORD, CRON_SECRET, AUTH_SECRET) explicitly.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>",
